OL,3,GNEWSAFlights in UK delayed by
OL,4,A'technical issue' with air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol in Scotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FPassengers have taken to social media
OL,8,Fto confirm they are experiencing delays
OL,9,Fat Glasgow, Prestwick and Edinburgh
OL,10,Fairports. Delays are also being
OL,11,Freported at Manchester and Belfast
OL,12,Fairports.
